WEBVTT

00:02:27.318 --> 00:02:30.767
in si natisnili svoje lastno zdravilo.

00:02:30.767 --> 00:02:33.019
in če se vam to ne zdi dovolj domišljeno,

00:02:33.019 --> 00:02:35.067
kam mislite, da bomo šli?

00:02:35.067 --> 00:02:39.651
No, imeli boste svoj
lastni izdelovalec žive snovi.

00:02:39.651 --> 00:02:41.551
Prežarči me, Scotty.

00:02:41.551 --> 00:02:44.900
(Aplavz)